luding the annual fee applied in the first year.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2109a75e\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank calculate the monthly payment for my loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The monthly payment is computed by summing the approved principal amount with the total interest that will accrue over the loan term, and then dividing that combined figure by the total number of months in the loan period. For additional details, please consult the Horizon Instant Loan Terms & Conditions.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_8984208c\", \"content\": \"Question: What charges does Horizon Bank apply to an Instant Loan?\\n\\nAnswer: - No annual fee is levied on Instant Loans that were originated before {{faq_8984208c_001}} February {{faq_8984208c_002}}.\\n- For Instant Loans opened on or after {{faq_8984208c_003}} February {{faq_8984208c_004}}:\\n  * A first‑year annual charge equal to {{faq_8984208c_005}} % of the loan amount is added to your Horizon credit card.\\n  * If the loan term is one year or longer, a {{faq_8984208c_006}} anniversary fee is assessed each year the loan remains outstanding, but only when the minimum payment on your Horizon credit card has not been received by its due date for the preceding {{faq_8984208c_007}} consecutive calendar months.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Check the fee schedule for processing, administrative, or late payment charges on personal loans.\", \"policy\": \"Fees are applied according to the bank's current schedule of charges for personal credit products.\", \"conceptual\": \"Fees and charges include all costs associated with maintaining or servicing a personal loan account.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Rewards And