ic product you wish to obtain.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Review your monthly statement to identify applied annual fees, late payment penalties, or foreign transaction service charges.\", \"policy\": \"Annual fees are charged once per year, while late payment fees apply if the minimum balance remains unpaid.\", \"conceptual\": \"Fees and charges represent the costs associated with maintaining a credit card account and performing specific transactions.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Fees And Charges\"], \"customer_component\": \"credit card fees and charges\", \"direct_query\": \"credit card fees and charges\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"customer_original_wording\": \"credit card fees\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Review your monthly statement to identify applied annual fees, late payment penalties, or foreign transaction service charges.\", \"policy\": \"Annual fees are charged once per year, while late payment fees apply if the minimum balance remains unpaid.\", \"conceptual\": \"Fees and charges represent the costs associated with maintaining a credit card account and performing specific transactions.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_5f31fc26\", \"content\": \"Question: What factors determine the monthly fee for transferring my balance to a Horizon Bank credit card?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, the monthly charge for balance transfers is calculated based on the outstanding balance. Prior to the final month of your tenure, a monthly fee of either {{faq_5f31fc26_001}} for transfers approved before August {{faq_5f31fc26_002}}, {{faq_5f31fc26_003}}, or {{faq_5f31fc26_004}} for transfers approved on or after August {{faq_5f31fc26_005}}, {{faq_5f31fc26_006}}, will be applied to your Horizon Bank credit card statement. This fee will be included in the minimum payment due. In the last month of your tenure, or if you opt to repay your balance early, the remaining outstanding balance will be charged to your statement, along with a {{faq_5f31fc26_007}} fee on the outstanding amount, which will also be included in the minimum payment due. For detailed information, please consult the Balance Transfer Product Terms and Key Facts document provided by Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1b3f3507\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank's foreign transaction fee policy work for international purchases made with my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we do not impose any foreign transaction or markup fees on your Horizon card, including the standard {{faq_1b3f3507_001}} fee typically charged by Visa. However, please note that when you use your Horizon card for international transactions through third-party payment platforms like Alipay or WeChat Pay, these platforms may charge their own service fees for processing international card payments. For details on any applicable fees, we recommend checking directly with the relevant payment platform.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_4659512d\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank determine when to charge interest on my Horizon card account, and what factors influence the interest rate I'm charged?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we provide a {{faq_4659512d_001}}-day interest-free period following the generation of your Horizon card statement. To avoid incurring interest, it's essential to settle your statement balance in full by the specified payment due date. If the balance remains unpaid, daily interest will be calculated at the applicable rate, which currently stands at {{faq_4659512d_002}} per annum, on both the outstanding balance from the previous statement date and any new transactions posted thereafter. Please note that from {{faq_4659512d_003}} July {{faq_4659512d_004}}, your Effective Interest Rate will be tailored to your individual credit behavior, ranging from {{faq_4659512d_005}} to {{faq_4659512d_006}} per annum. Additionally, taking a cash advance will also incur interest charges. For a comprehensive overview of our interest, fees, and charges, we invite you to review the Key Fact Sheet available on our Horizon App or website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2ba8c382\", \"content\": \"Question: If I fail to make a payment on multiple Horizon Bank credit cards, will I incur a late fee for each card or a single fee for my combined statement?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we provide a consolidated statement for all your Horizon cards. In the event of a missed payment, you will be charged a single late fee, which will be applied across all your Horizon cards, rather than incurring separate late fees for each individual card.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents. It also contains `task.customer_original_wording`: the\n          customer's own faithful wording for this task, which may be\n          plainer or vaguer than `customer_component` (which can be\n          elaborated with retrieval-oriented wording the customer never\n          actually said). Use `customer_original_wording`, never\n          `customer_component`, as the source when you set `unresolved_term`\n          below -- a clarifying question must quote something the customer\n          will recognize as their own.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          fact