{"timestamp": "2026-08-29T05:38:16.155+00:00", "event": "llm.response", "session_id": "verify5-1787981854", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_response": "{\n  \"elements\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"TEXT\",\n      \"source_task_ids\": [\n        \"task_1\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"To qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering, current clients need to possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit 💳. New applicants—including Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals—are all permitted to apply, and every submission is subject to our credit-worthiness assessment ✨. Applicants must be aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years. Singapore citizens and permanent residents require a minimum annual income of {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}}, while foreign nationals holding a valid work pass need an annual income of at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}}.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"TEXT\",\n      \"source_task_ids\": [\n        \"task_2\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"Regarding credit card fees and policies at Horizon Bank, we do not impose any foreign transaction or markup fees on your Horizon card, including the standard {{faq_1b3f3507_001}} fee typically charged by Visa. However, please note that third-party payment platforms like Alipay or WeChat Pay may charge their own service fees for processing international card payments 🌍. If you hold multiple Horizon cards, we provide a consolidated statement, and in the event of a missed payment, a single late fee will be applied across all your Horizon cards rather than separate fees for each card. Additionally, your account features a {{faq_4659512d_001}}-day interest-free period following statement generation, and you can avoid incurring interest by settling your statement balance in full by the specified payment due date 📅.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"clarification\": \"\"\n}", "elapsed_ms": 2480.43}
