me is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"credit card fees and charges\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_1b3f3507\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank's foreign transaction fee policy work for international purchases made with my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we do not impose any foreign transaction or markup fees on your Horizon card, including the standard {{faq_1b3f3507_001}} fee typically charged by Visa. However, please note that when you use your Horizon card for international transactions through third-party payment platforms like Alipay or WeChat Pay, these platforms may charge their own service fees for processing international card payments. For details on any applicable fees, we recommend checking directly with the relevant payment platform.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_2ba8c382\", \"content\": \"Question: If I fail to make a payment on multiple Horizon Bank credit cards, will I incur a late fee for each card or a single fee for my combined statement?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we provide a consolidated statement for all your Horizon cards. In the event of a missed payment, you will be charged a single late fee, which will be applied across all your Horizon cards, rather than incurring separate late fees for each individual card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_4659512d\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank determine when to charge interest on my Horizon card account, and what factors influence the interest rate I'm charged?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we provide a {{faq_4659512d_001}}-day interest-free period following the generation of your Horizon card statement. To avoid incurring interest, it's essential to settle your statement balance in full by the specified payment due date. If the balance remains unpaid, daily interest will be calculated at the applicable rate, which currently stands at {{faq_46595