 is unfamiliar. For category=\"individual_customers_only\", name the non-individual segment (e.g., business, corporate) in decline.reason without asserting whether Horizon does or does not serve that segment in reality — only that this assistant's information does not cover it. The customer-facing decline sentence itself is generated deterministically downstream from decline.category -- do not draft one here.\n    8. Use \"ALL\" only when a component is genuinely universal and its Intent is a valid intent listed under \"ALL\" in the Product/Intent Matrix. \"ALL\" is not a fallback for an unknown product.\n\n    Output JSON ONLY:\n    {\"components\": [{\"component_id\":\"component_1\",\"customer_component\":\"open an account\",\"resolution\":\"SEARCH\",\"search_task\":{\"task_id\":\"task_1\",\"angle_groups\":[{\"group_id\":\"base\",\"procedural\":\"...\",\"policy\":\"...\",\"conceptual\":\"...\"}],\"target_commercial_product\":\"Deposit_Account\",\"target_intent\":[\"Application\"]},\"clarification\":null,\"decline\":null},{\"component_id\":\"component_2\",\"customer_component\":\"the fee\",\"resolution\":\"CLARIFY\",\"search_task\":null,\"clarification\":{\"clarification_id\":\"intent_clarification_1\",\"unresolved_request\":\"the fee\",\"reason\":\"No product or service is identified.\",\"candidate_replies\":[]},\"decline\":null},{\"component_id\":\"component_5\",\"customer_component\":\"how to apply for a loan\",\"resolution\":\"CLARIFY\",\"search_task\":null,\"clarification\":{\"clarification_id\":\"intent_clarification_2\",\"unresolved_request\":\"loan\",\"reason\":\"Personal_Loan is the only loan-type matrix product, but the customer's intended type is not confirmed.\",\"candidate_replies\":[{\"label\":\"Personal Loan\",\"message\":\"I'm asking about a personal loan.\",\"reason\":\"Personal_Loan is the only loan-type Matrix product.\"}]},\"decline\":null},{\"component_id\":\"component_6\",\"customer_component\":\"I have a question about my loan\",\"resolution\":\"CLARIFY\",\"search_task\":null,\"clarification\":{\"clarification_id\":\"intent_clarification_3\",\"unresolved_request\":\"a question about my loan\",\"reason\":\"Product (Personal_Loan) is unambiguous, but no verb, action, or outcome is given -- Application, Repayment, and Eligibility are all equally plausible intents with no basis to prefer one.\",\"candidate_replies\":[{\"label\":\"Applying\",\"message\":\"I want to know how to apply for a loan.\",\"reason\":\"Application is a valid Matrix intent for Personal_Loan.\"},{\"label\":\"Repayment\",\"message\":\"I want to know about repaying my loan.\",\"reason\":\"Repayment is a valid Matrix intent for Personal_Loan.\"},{\"label\":\"Eligibility\",\"message\":\"I want to know if I'm eligible for a loan.\",\"reason\":\"Eligibility is a valid Matrix intent for Personal_Loan.\"}]},\"decline\":null},{\"component_id\":\"component_3\",\"customer_component\":\"margin trading account\",\"resolution\":\"DECLINE\",\"search_task\":null,\"clarification\":null,\"decline\":{\"reason\":\"Horizon does not offer margin trading accounts.\",\"category\":\"out_of_scope_product\"}},{\"component_id\":\"component_4\",\"customer_component\":\"business credit card annual fee\",\"resolution\":\"DECLINE\",\"search_task\":null,\"clarification\":null,\"decline\":{\"reason\":\"This assistant's information covers individual credit cards only, not business credit cards.\",\"category\":\"individual_customers_only\"}}]}\n    \n    "}
