ote that from {{faq_df0e6cbd_007}} July {{faq_df0e6cbd_008}}, your Effective Interest Rate will be tailored to your individual credit profile, ranging from {{faq_df0e6cbd_009}} to {{faq_df0e6cbd_010}} per annum.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_4659512d\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank determine when to charge interest on my Horizon card account, and what factors influence the interest rate I'm charged?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we provide a {{faq_4659512d_001}}-day interest-free period following the generation of your Horizon card statement. To avoid incurring interest, it's essential to settle your statement balance in full by the specified payment due date. If the balance remains unpaid, daily interest will be calculated at the applicable rate, which currently stands at {{faq_4659512d_002}} per annum, on both the outstanding balance from the previous statement date and any new transactions posted thereafter. Please note that from {{faq_4659512d_003}} July {{faq_4659512d_004}}, your Effective Interest Rate will be tailored to your individual credit behavior, ranging from {{faq_4659512d_005}} to {{faq_4659512d_006}} per annum. Additionally, taking a cash advance will also incur interest charges. For a comprehensive overview of our interest, fees, and charges, we invite you to review the Key Fact Sheet available on our Horizon App or website.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e5db6d91\", \"content\": \"Question: Are there any fees associated with obtaining a supplementary Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank does not levy any issuance or annual fees for an additional card. All expenses incurred on the supplementary card are combined with the primary card’s balance, and any late‑payment penalties or interest charges are applied exclusively to the main cardholder.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against 