 Prior to the final month of your tenure, a monthly fee of either {{faq_5f31fc26_001}} for transfers approved before August {{faq_5f31fc26_002}}, {{faq_5f31fc26_003}}, or {{faq_5f31fc26_004}} for transfers approved on or after August {{faq_5f31fc26_005}}, {{faq_5f31fc26_006}}, applies. In the final month or upon early repayment, the remaining balance along with a {{faq_5f31fc26_007}} fee on the outstanding amount is charged to your statement.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"title\": \"Supplementary Cards\",\n          \"content\": \"Horizon Bank does not levy any issuance or annual fees for obtaining an additional supplementary card. All expenses are combined with the primary card's balance.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"extended_text\": \"For a comprehensive overview of all interest, fees, and charges, please review the Key Fact Sheet available on the Horizon App or website.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"clarification\": \"\"\n}", "elapsed_ms": 3198.93}
