mes a shortcut not present in\n          \"available_shortcuts\", invents a detail beyond the supplied\n          label/topic/for_request (a step, field, screen layout, url, count,\n          or id), claims a shortcut replaces or invalidates a *different*\n          evidence-based answer than the one its own for_request names, or\n          claims execution/completion. Do not reject a compliant statement\n          merely for existing, and do not require decline/apology framing\n          for a subquery whose only coverage is a matching shortcut.\n        - \"unavailable_service_requests\" entries are a permitted source only\n          for a brief sentence stating that part of the request could not be\n          started, using only the supplied reason. Any different explanation\n          is unsupported.\n        - \"verified_api_context\" entries are a permitted factual source, on\n          the same footing as Task-Level Approved Evidence, but each entry\n          supports only the exact statement in its own `fact` text -- no\n          extrapolation beyond it.\n        - \"personal_data_placeholders\" entries permit a customer-facing\n          sentence to include an entry's `insert_token` verbatim when the\n          sentence addresses that same entry's `for_request`. The sentence\n          must never state, paraphrase, or guess the real value the token\n          represents (it is never disclosed to the assistant, so it can\n          never legitimately appear as prose) and must never use a\n          `{data-*}` token that is not present in this list.\n        \n\n        ============================================================\n        Customer-Facing Content (assess against BOTH axes above):\n        \n        Original Customer Message (courtesy-context only; never a source for a\n        banking fact, instruction, product capability, policy, or outcome):\n        \"neither, i mean that\"\n\n        Optional Internal Response-Element Provenance (not customer-facing):\n        []\n\n        Clarification Inputs (the only source for what a clarifying\n        question may be about -- exactly what the generator itself was\n        given, nothing more: \"scope\" names where in the pipeline the\n        ambiguity blocks progress, \"unresolved_request\" is the specific\n        thing that's unclear -- the generator composed its own question\n        from this, there is no fixed sentence to compare against -- and\n        0-3 \"clarification_guesses\" are PREDICTIONS of likely customer\n        intent, never reports of anything actually said):\n        [{\"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"scope\": \"Classifying whether this request is a compliant banking question, an explicit request for a human agent, or something outside what this assistant can help with, before any decomposition into components was attempted.\", \"unresolved_request\": \"the user's intent behind 'i mean that' in response to the assistant's request to choose between resubmitting KYC or changing address\", \"clarification_guesses\": [{\"label\": \"Resubmit KYC\", \"message\": \"I would like to proceed with resubmitting my KYC document.\", \"reason\": \"The user was presented with this as the first option in the assistant's prompt.\"}, {\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"message\": \"I would like to proceed with changing my address.\", \"reason\": \"The user was presented with this as the second option in the assistant's prompt.\"}]}]\n\n        Terminal Unresolved Task Markers (topic/status only; never evidence):\n        []\n\n        Decline Inputs (the only source for a declined-topic explanation):\n        []\n\n        No-Info Inputs (the only source for an unavailable-information statement):\n        []\n\n        Customer-Facing Answer:\n        \"\"\n\n        Customer-Facing Clarification:\n        \"Could you please clarify your intent? Are you looking to resubmit your KYC document (meaning your identity verification documents) or would you prefer to proceed with changing your address? 📋\"\n\n        Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n        \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"clarification\", \"text\": \"Could you please clarify your intent? Are you looking to resubmit your KYC document (meaning your identity verification documents) or would you prefer to proceed with changing your address? 📋\", \"options\": [{\"label\": \"Resubmit KYC\", \"message\": \"I would like to proceed with resubmitting my KYC document.\"}, {\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"message\": \"I would like to proceed with changing my address.\"}]}]}\"\n        \n\n        Output JSON only:\n        {\"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"conduct_reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/false, \"rewrite_instruction\": \"...\", \"evidence_grounded\": true/false, \"evidence_reason\": \"...\", \"evidence_violations\": [{\"scope\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"], \"evidence_gap\": \"...\"}], \"answer_evidence_grounded\": true/false, \"answer_bridge_grounded\": true/false, \"clarification_grounded\": true/false, \"clarification_connected\": true/false, \"response_recovery_strategy\":\"NO_STRATEGY\" | \"REMOVE_UNSUPPORTED_CONTENT\" | \"NARROW_TO_EVIDENCE_SCOPE\" | \"CLARIFY_FROM_ALLOWED_CONTEXT\", \"grounding_violations\": [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"scope\": \"answer\" | \"ui_payload\" | \"clarification\", \"audit_layer\": \"evidence\" | \"bridge\" | \"other\", \"violation_type\": \"unsupported_factual_claim\" | \"unsupported_bridge_inference\" | \"unsupported_instruction\" | \"wrong_task_evidence\" | \"unsupported_clarification_suggestion\" | \"missing_d