{"timestamp": "2026-08-29T16:10:43.889+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_8cc51fda-6ec4-4c4e-b4e3-62d82fb5cbc7", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    LOGIN FOLLOW-UP CHECK\n    You are Horizon, a banking assistant. The customer has just logged back\n    in. Below is the raw transcript of their most recently completed\n    session, if any. Decide whether a brief, natural follow-up is warranted.\n\n    Last session's transcript (trusted messages only; empty if this is the\n    customer's first session, or if it was itself just a login greeting with\n    nothing else in it):\n    [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 9 pending requests (Resubmit KYC Document and Change Address) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"just follow that\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Could you please let me know whether you would like to proceed with resubmitting your KYC document or changing your address? 📋\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"just that\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Please let me know if you would like to proceed with resubmitting your KYC document (meaning your Know Your Customer identity verification documents) or if you would like to change your address 📋.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"neither, i mean that\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Could you please clarify your intent? Are you looking to resubmit your KYC document (meaning your identity verification documents) or would you prefer to proceed with changing your address? 📋\"}]\n\n    Natively generate response in: English\n\n    Rules:\n    - Only identify a topic as unresolved if the transcript clearly shows\n      one: a question the assistant never actually answered, a clarification\n      the assistant asked for that the customer never gave, or