our credit card application through the bank website or mobile app with income proof.\", \"policy\": \"Credit card approval is subject to minimum income requirements and a review of your credit history.\", \"conceptual\": \"A credit card is a payment tool that allows you to borrow funds up to a limit.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\"], \"customer_component\": \"How to apply for a credit card at Horizon Bank.\", \"direct_query\": \"How to apply for a credit card at Horizon Bank.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit your credit card application through the bank website or mobile app with income proof.\", \"policy\": \"Credit card approval is subject to minimum income requirements and a review of your credit history.\", \"conceptual\": \"A credit card is a payment tool that allows you to borrow funds up to a limit.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_dea282b8\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for using Horizon Bank’s online credit‑card application?\\n\\nAnswer: - Initiate a Horizon credit‑card request through a partner’s mobile app or website.\\n- The submission is handled on a secure Horizon Bank web portal.\\n- Utilize the MyInfo service to auto‑populate your personal details.\\n- Receive immediate status updates, and be prompted for any additional actions required within the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_85dbaadf\", \"content\": \"Question: What documentation is required to initiate a Horizon Bank credit card application?\\n\\nAnswer: To streamline your credit card application with Horizon Bank, Singaporean citizens and permanent residents can utilize MyInfo for expedited form completion. For foreign applicants, please ensure you have your passport and most recent payslip readily available for upload or photo capture via the Horizon App, in addition to accessing MyInfo.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_c241b12d\", \"content\": \"Question: As a senior citizen, am I eligible to apply for a Horizon Bank credit card, and what are the key requirements I need to fulfill?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we welcome applications from retirees who meet specific criteria. To qualify for our credit card with a credit limit of {{faq_c241b12d_001}}, you must be a Singapore citizen or permanent resident, aged {{faq_c241b12d_002}} or above, have an assessed annual income of less than {{faq_c241b12d_003}}, and not hold any existing credit cards or unsecured loans with us. If you meet these conditions, you may be eligible for our credit card, subject to our standard banking requirements.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_d8b75c7d\", \"content\": \"Question: As an existing Standard Chartered credit cardholder, can I bypass the application process for a Horizon Bank credit card?\\n\\nAnswer: While having an existing credit card does not exempt you from applying for a Horizon Bank credit card, our streamlined application process is designed to be efficient and hassle-free. Please note that for Singaporean citizens or permanent residents with an annual income ranging from {{faq_d8b75c7d_001}} to {{faq_d8b75c7d_002}}, your Horizon Bank credit limit will be combined with your Standard Chartered credit limit, as per regulatory requirements.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"Check your eligibility status by logging into your account or contacting our customer service team.\", \"policy\": \"Existing credit card holders may qualify for loans based on their repayment history and current credit score.\", \"conceptual\": \"Loan eligibility refers to the criteria a customer must meet to be approved for a personal loan.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Eligibility\"], \"customer_component\": \"Eligibility requirements for applying for a loan if I already ho