{"timestamp": "2026-08-29T17:50:24.099+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_addc6e31-5bca-4312-aafb-a0a764171951", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    LOGIN FOLLOW-UP CHECK\n    You are Horizon, a banking assistant. The customer has just logged back\n    in. Below is the raw transcript of their most recently completed\n    session, if any. Decide whether a brief, natural follow-up is warranted.\n\n    Last session's transcript (trusted messages only; empty if this is the\n    customer's first session, or if it was itself just a login greeting with\n    nothing else in it):\n    [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 9 pending requests (Resubmit KYC Document and Change Address) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\\n\\nWould you like to continue with your pending requests to resubmit your KYC document or change your address?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"no, i don't. i want that\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Could you please clarify what you would like to do? For example, are you looking to resubmit your KYC (Know Your Customer) document or change your address? 📋\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"i don't want kyc or change address, i want another\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Could you please clarify what other banking service you would like to look into? For example, would you like to check your account balance 💳, view your transaction history, or speak with a human agent about your account?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"what else\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Can you list the other banking services you can help me with, or would you prefer to speak with a human agent to discuss your account? 🏦\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Could you please clarify if you would like to learn more about the general services Horizon Bank offers or if you are interested in opening a new savings account? 🤔\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"I would like to learn more about the general services Horizon Bank offers.\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I do not currently have information available regarding the general banking services offered by Horizon Bank. 🏦\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"how to open an account and how to apply credit card and can i also apply for loan if i have credit card\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To open a savings account with Horizon Bank, you will need a mobile phone along with MyInfo verification to auto-populate your application form. If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\\n\\nTo apply for a credit card, Singaporean citizens and permanent residents can use MyInfo for expedited form completion on the secure Horizon Bank web portal, which can be initiated through a partner's mobile app or website. Foreign applicants should ensure they have their passport and most recent payslip ready for upload or photo capture via the Horizon App, in addition to accessing MyInfo. You will receive immediate status updates and prompts for any additional actions required within the app.\\n\\nIf you already possess a Horizon credit card and have an adequate unused credit limit, you may apply for Horizon Bank's Instant Loan offering, provided you meet the general eligibility criteria such as age limits and annual income requirements. Every submission is subject to Horizon Bank's credit-worthiness assessment.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"what docs\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To open a savings account with Horizon Bank, you will need a mobile phone along with MyInfo verification to auto-populate your application form. If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after successfully registering, you will still need to authenticate via SingPass when you log in again.\\n\\nTo apply for a credit card, Singaporean citizens and permanent residents can use MyInfo for expedited form completion. Foreign applicants should ensure they have their passport and most recent payslip ready for upload or photo capture via the Horizon App, in addition to accessing MyInfo.\\n\\nI don't have information available regarding what documents are required to apply for a Horizon Bank instant loan.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"no, i mean that, also can i buy stock?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To start buying and selling stocks and other securities with Horizon Bank, you will need to set up a securities trading account. You can do this by opening the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and choosing the Stocks feature to follow the on-screen setup prompts. Please note that opening this account is subject to an internal evaluation by Horizon Bank.\\n\\nStocks Account Details\\nAvailable Investment Options: Horizon Bank offers trading for stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, as well as a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds.\\nEligibility Requirements: To be eligible for a Stocks account, you must have an active Savings account with Horizon Bank and be between 18 and 74 years old. Individuals classified as US persons are not eligible to open a Stocks account.\\nDeposit Insurance Coverage: Investments and cash balances held within your Horizon Bank Stocks account are not covered by the Deposit Insurance Scheme administered by the Singapore Deposit Insurance Corporation (SDIC).\\n\\nI don't have information available regarding: What documents are required to apply for a Horizon Bank instant loan?.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"why you cannot\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Horizon Bank does not provide any investment advice to customers.\"}]\n\n    Natively generate response in: English\n\n    Rules:\n    - Only identify a topic as unresolved if the transcript clearly shows\n      one: a question the assistant never actually answered, a clarification\n      the assistant asked for that the customer never gave, or an escalation\n      that never concluded. A session that ended with a complete answer, or\n      that was only ever a greeting with nothing else in it, has nothing\n      unresolved -- do not invent a topic to follow up on.\n    - If a topic is unresolved, name it in your own words (never quote\n      internal ids) and ask, in one sentence, whether the customer would\n      like to continue it.\n    - Do not repeat or restate the login greeting itself.\n    - If there is no unresolved topic, or the transcript is empty, return an\n      empty string -- an empty follow-up is the normal, expected outcome for\n      most logins, not a failure.\n    - Keep it to at most two sentences. Do not invent any fact, banking\n      procedure, or policy not present above.\n\n    Output JSON only: {\"followup\": \"one or two sentences, or an empty string\"}\n    "}
