{"timestamp": "2026-08-30T05:54:13.813+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_34b8d4ca-98a6-44b9-8f7c-dc40f231349c", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    LOGIN FOLLOW-UP CHECK\n    You are Horizon, a banking assistant. The customer has just logged back\n    in. Below is the raw transcript of their most recently completed\n    session, if any. Decide whether a brief, natural follow-up is warranted.\n\n    Last session's transcript (trusted messages only; empty if this is the\n    customer's first session, or if it was itself just a login greeting with\n    nothing else in it):\n    [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Benson! How can I help with your banking today? Also, you still have 9 pending requests (Resubmit KYC Document and Change Address) — you can check them anytime from the requests icon in the top right.\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Initial Steps to Begin Trading: To initiate trading activities, it is necessary to establish a securities trading account. This can be accomplished by navigating to the Horizon App, selecting the Investments option, and then choosing the Stocks feature. Upon doing so, adhere to the on-screen prompts to finalize the account setup. Please be aware that the approval to open this account is contingent upon an internal evaluation conducted by Horizon Bank.\\nInvestment Opportunities and Minimum Thresholds: Horizon Bank provides its clients with the ability to engage in trading activities involving stocks and exchange-traded funds listed on US exchanges, in addition to a selection of UK UCITS exchange-traded funds. You have the flexibility to initiate your investment portfolio by buying stocks and ETFs with a minimum investment of just USD 10.\\nEligibility Criteria: To be eligible for a Stocks account, you must meet the following conditions: \\n      * You should have an active Savings account with Horizon Bank. If you haven't already, you can easily open one through the Horizon App.\\n      * Your age should be between 18 and 74 years. Additionally, please be aware that individuals classified as US persons are not eligible to open a Stocks account with Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"how to open account\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"To get started with buying and selling securities, you can easily set up your securities trading account directly through the Horizon App. 📱\\n\\nLaunch the Horizon App on your device.\\n\\nNavigate to and select the Investments option.\\n\\nSelect the Stocks feature and follow the on-screen prompts to complete your setup. Please note that account approval is subject to an internal evaluation by Horizon Bank.\\n\\nHere are the eligibility requirements you need to meet in order to open a Stocks account:\\nYou must have an active Savings account with Horizon Bank. If you need one, you can easily open it through the Horizon App.\\nYour age must be between 18 and 74 years.\\nPlease note that individuals classified as US persons are not eligible to open a Stocks account with Horizon Bank.\"}]\n\n    Natively generate response in: English\n\n    Rules:\n    - Only identify a topic as unresolved if the transcript clearly shows\n      one: a question the assistant never actually answered, a clarification\n      the assistant asked for that the customer never gave, or an escalation\n      that never concluded. A session that ended with a complete answer, or\n      that was only ever a greeting with nothing else in it, has nothing\n      unresolved -- do not invent a topic to follow up on.\n    - If a topic is unresolved, name it in your own words (never quote\n      internal ids) and ask, in one sentence, whether the customer would\n      like to continue it.\n    - Do not repeat or restate the login greeting itself.\n    - If there is no unresolved topic, or the transcript is empty, return an\n      empty string -- an empty follow-up is the normal, expected outcome for\n      most logins, not a failure.\n    - Keep it to at most two sentences. Do not invent any fact, banking\n      procedure, or policy not present above.\n\n    Output JSON only: {\"followup\": \"one or two sentences, or an empty string\"}\n    "}
