ply as a percentage of the transaction amount plus any applicable processing charges\", \"conceptual\": \"A cash advance is a short-term loan service allowing credit cardholders to withdraw physical currency against limits\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_df0e6cbd\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the charges associated with withdrawing cash using my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: As of {{faq_df0e6cbd_001}} February {{faq_df0e6cbd_002}}, Horizon Bank imposes a cash advance fee of {{faq_df0e6cbd_003}} on the withdrawn amount, although transactions below {{faq_df0e6cbd_004}} are exempt from this charge. Additionally, a daily interest rate of {{faq_df0e6cbd_005}} (equivalent to {{faq_df0e6cbd_006}} per annum) is applied to the withdrawn amount, starting from the transaction posting date until the payment is made in full. Please note that from {{faq_df0e6cbd_007}} July {{faq_df0e6cbd_008}}, your Effective Interest Rate will be tailored to your individual credit profile, ranging from {{faq_df0e6cbd_009}} to {{faq_df0e6cbd_010}} per annum.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e0227a70\", \"content\": \"Question: Does Horizon Bank have the flexibility to adjust my available cash advance limit on my Horizon card at its discretion?\\n\\nAnswer: Indeed, Horizon Bank retains the authority to modify your cash advance limit as needed, which may involve reducing the available amount.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_56c5d6d9\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the minimum transaction amount required to qualify for cashback rewards with my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: To be eligible for cashback, your transaction must be at least {{faq_56c5d6d9_001}}. Additionally, the cashback earned from each transaction will be rounded to two decimal places for simplicity and accuracy.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5f31fc26\", \"content\": \"Question: What factors determine the monthly fee for transferring my balance to a Horizon Ban