nterested in opening a savings account.\",\n          \"reason\": \"Multiple retrieved parents specifically discuss the application process for a Horizon Bank Savings Account.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Credit Card\",\n          \"message\": \"I am interested in opening a credit card account.\",\n          \"reason\": \"One retrieved parent mentions credit card application requirements and rejection reasons.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}", "elapsed_ms": 2657.61}
