 Address of Pass Holder.”\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_014}}. Input your Main Pass ID and search.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_015}}. Edit the residential postal address and save the changes.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_cc2bb0f9\", \"content\": \"Question: What prerequisites must I meet to open a Savings Account with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: - A mobile device and MyInfo authentication are sufficient to auto‑populate your application form.\\n- If you delete or reinstall the Horizon App after completing registration, you will still need to use SingPass to verify your identity when you log in again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_93d37190\", \"content\": \"Question: After opening a savings account, am I eligible to apply for a Horizon credit card?\\n\\nAnswer: - Eligibility criteria:\\n  - You are between {{faq_93d37190_001}} and {{faq_93d37190_002}} years old and earn at least {{faq_93d37190_003}} annually, and you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n  - You are older than {{faq_93d37190_004}} years and earn at least {{faq_93d37190_005}} annually, and you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\nOnly Singapore citizens and permanent residents can hold both a Horizon savings account and a Horizon credit card. To submit an application, go to **More > More for you** within the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_a3bab790\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the requirements to become a Horizon Bank premium customer?\\n\\nAnswer: To enjoy the exclusive benefits of Horizon Bank's premium tier, simply ensure that your total Average Daily Balance in your Horizon savings account, combined with the value of your HorizonInvest Mutual Funds or Stocks, reaches a minimum of {{faq_a3bab790_001}}. Once this threshold is met, you will automatically be upgraded to our premium tier for the following three months. To continue enjoying these privileges, maintain the minimum {{faq_a3bab790_002}} total balance, and you will remain a valued premium customer for the subsequent three-month